  data: {
    LLM: "Pay attention to which suits have been played. Try to remember who has dominoes with matching suits. There is very little strategyâ€”the game is almost entirely luck-based.\n\nWatch the order of other players' dominoes in their lines. If you observe that a player's line is getting shorter on the left (where won dominoes are added), they may be winning tricks. Arrange your own won dominoes strategically by placing them in positions that favor future leads.\n\nWhile primarily luck-based, skilled players can increase odds slightly by managing the positioning of won tiles. If you must arrange captured dominoes in your line, cluster matching suits together to improve your chances of holding matching tiles when needed. However, the random nature of face-down tiles limits advanced strategy.",
    Player: "Pay attention to which suits have been played. Try to remember who has dominoes with matching suits. There is very little strategyâ€”the game is almost entirely luck-based.\n\nWatch the order of other players' dominoes in their lines. If you observe that a player's line is getting shorter on the left (where won dominoes are added), they may be winning tricks. Arrange your own won dominoes strategically by placing them in positions that favor future leads.\n\nWhile primarily luck-based, skilled players can increase odds slightly by managing the positioning of won tiles. If you must arrange captured dominoes in your line, cluster matching suits together to improve your chances of holding matching tiles when needed. However, the random nature of face-down tiles limits advanced strategy.",
